English translation (for convenience; the Chinese text governs)

1. SCOPE. This license covers everything in this repository authored by the
   copyright holder: source code, documentation, specifications, disassembly
   notes, translation-correction records and tools. It does NOT cover the
   original game's executables, data files, artwork, music, bitmap fonts, or
   anything directly derived from them. Those belong to their respective
   rights holders; this project does not distribute them, and users must
   supply their own lawful copy of the original game.

2. FREE GRANT. Subject to Section 3, anyone may, free of charge:
   (a) use, run, reproduce and distribute this work for personal,
       educational, research, preservation or other NON-COMMERCIAL purposes;
   (b) modify this work and distribute the modified version under the same
       non-commercial condition.

3. CONDITIONS.
   (a) Retain this license and the copyright notice in all distributions.
   (b) When distributing a modified version, state clearly that it is
       modified, what was changed, and point to the original source at
       https://github.com/wicanr2/chengshi_cht . Do not imply that the
       modified version comes from the copyright holder, and do not use the
       copyright holder's name in a confusing way.
   (c) Do not charge a fee for obtaining or using the work itself (actual
       cost of physical media and shipping excepted).
   (d) Do not distribute the original game's assets (see Section 1).

4. COMMERCIAL USE REQUIRES A SEPARATE AGREEMENT. Commercial use falls
   outside the free grant in Section 2 and requires prior written permission
   from the copyright holder. Commercial use includes, without limitation:
   selling this work or a modified version, offering it for a fee or by
   subscription, bundling it with a product or service, adding advertising
   or in-app purchases, and using it in the operations of a for-profit
   entity. Enquiries are welcome at wicanr2@gmail.com — this section exists
   to keep commercial terms negotiable, not to refuse cooperation.

5. NO WARRANTY. THE WORK IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND,
   EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF
   MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT.
   TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, THE COPYRIGHT HOLDER SHALL NOT BE
   LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY ARISING FROM THE WORK OR
   ITS USE.

6. TERMINATION AND REINSTATEMENT. Rights under this license terminate
   automatically upon breach. If the breach is cured within thirty days of
   becoming aware of it, and the copyright holder is notified, the license is
   reinstated as of the date of cure.

