附註（不構成授權條款的一部分）
Notes (not part of the license terms)

商標：SimCity、SimCity 2000 與 Maxis 是 Electronic Arts Inc. 的商標或註冊
商標。Micropolis 是該 GPL 版本自己的名稱。本專案與 Electronic Arts、
Maxis、Will Wright、DUX Software、軟體世界或骨灰集散地皆無隸屬關係，
也未獲其背書。上述名稱僅用於指稱原版作品，屬指示性使用。

規格參考揭露：本專案的模擬規則規格參考了 Micropolis（Electronic Arts 於
2008 年以 GPL-3.0 釋出的 SimCity Unix 版原始碼）。程式碼由本專案以 Go
重新撰寫，未複製 Micropolis 的原始碼。著作權人據此主張本作品不是
Micropolis 的衍生著作，因而不受 GPL-3.0 拘束；此為著作權人的立場，
非法院見解。詳見 CLAUDE.md §1 與 docs/spec/ 各份規格的證據引用。

Trademarks: SimCity and Maxis are trademarks of Electronic Arts Inc.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Electronic Arts, Maxis,
Will Wright, DUX Software, Soft-World, or oldgame.tw. Names are used
nominatively to identify the original work.

Specification reference disclosure: the simulation rules in this project
were specified with reference to Micropolis (the SimCity Unix source
released by Electronic Arts under GPL-3.0 in 2008). All code here is newly
written in Go; no Micropolis source was copied. The copyright holder's
position is that this work is therefore not a derivative work of Micropolis
and not bound by GPL-3.0. That is the holder's position, not a court ruling.
